referenceFunction.generalComment:
The functional unit represent 1 kg of liquid ethylbenzene. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process and missing data on process emissions.;
CAS number: 000100-41-4; 
Formula: C8H10; 
Synonyms: phenylethane, Phenolethan; 
